Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:58:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] feat: expand activity automation to per-action switches
 (8 total)

Split the coarse share-reward switch into share/daily/milestones, and
add solar-term claim, milk-tea cashier claim and milk-tea wages claim,
matching the BuildAtDawn switch granularity for currently-live content.
Expired activities (qingmei/charity/qixi/weather/pet/wish) stay excluded
per earlier decision; consumption actions (star-sand exchange,
constellation) deliberately not automated.
